@startuml pipeline
title Поток данных инфраструктуры бенчмаркинга

actor Пользователь
participant "main.py" as main
participant "src/download.py" as download
participant "src/prepare_matrices.py" as prepare
participant "src/benchmark/<tool>.py" as bench
participant "src/common.py" as common
database "matrices.yaml" as cfg
database "matrices/" as mtx
database "tools/ dependencies/" as ext
database "results/raw/" as res
database "logs/" as log

Пользователь -> main : uv run main.py download
main -> download
download -> cfg : чтение enabled матриц\n(уникальные по имени)
download -> mtx : скачать .tar.gz,\nраспаковать .mtx
download --> log

Пользователь -> main : uv run main.py prepare-matrices
main -> prepare
prepare -> cfg : чтение матриц
prepare -> mtx : приведение к неотрицательным\nцелым
prepare -> mtx : для reorder=true\nпостроить *_reordered.mtx (RCM)
prepare --> log

Пользователь -> main : uv run main.py benchmark <tool>
main -> bench
bench -> cfg : get_enabled_matrices_for_tool
bench -> ext : подготовка (сборка make,\nuv sync, конвертация .mtx→.in,\nсимлинки)
bench -> common : run_benchmarks\n(run_tool_many_times)
common -> bench : run_tool (subprocess)\nпо потокам/запускам
bench -> common : собрать результаты\n(Results)
common -> res : write_results\n<timestamp>_<tool>.json
bench --> log
@enduml
